#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:2 d302dcef0c5d4d7b87512571a2935947
msgid "Transfers and administration"
msgstr "转账与管理"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:6 6d8a61affc3e4454a5e29d6989f3b5a4
msgid ""
"The methods on this page can move funds, spend fees, change account "
"authority, alter protocol state, or perform irreversible conversions. "
"They are listed for discovery only. Do not invoke them from copied "
"examples. Confirm the selected network, execution address, destination, "
"units, permissions, and rollback procedure in your own application before"
" signing."
msgstr ""
"本页方法可转移资金、花费费用、改变账户权限、更改协议状态或执行不可逆转换。"
"它们仅供发现使用。不要从复制的示例中调用它们。签名前，请在自己的应用中确认所选网络、执行地址、"
"目标地址、单位、权限和回滚程序。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:13 8ac726651f834a12b5f113dcb8428d55
msgid "Fund movement"
msgstr "资金转移"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:15 23570d6629754568bb2c6ae1ce67c0d7
msgid "Coin-resolving methods live on ``AsyncHyperliquid``:"
msgstr "解析 coin 的方法位于 ``AsyncHyperliquid``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:17 e0084ec093ed4023964c9dbba4bd18f3
msgid "``spot_transfer`` sends a spot token after resolving its token metadata;"
msgstr "``spot_transfer`` 在解析 token 元数据后发送一个 spot token；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:18 4d82ad8c5dd14e6e893551862015302f
msgid "``send_asset`` moves a token between DEX contexts or destinations;"
msgstr "``send_asset`` 在 DEX 上下文或目标地址之间转移 token；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:19 481708aefa01493aa7c824b37468713e
msgid "``agent_send_asset`` submits the agent-signed variant;"
msgstr "``agent_send_asset`` 提交 agent 签名的变体；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:20 f2a309b0524c4552bbfb9a072e9aa75d
msgid ""
"``send_to_evm_with_data`` sends a token to an external-chain recipient "
"with caller-supplied encoding, chain ID, gas limit, and data."
msgstr ""
"``send_to_evm_with_data`` 使用调用方提供的编码、链 ID、gas 限制和数据，"
"将 token 发送给外部链接收方。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:23 e93a76ca413b4cd7bec88d244013c0bd
msgid "Info-independent methods live on ``client.exchange``:"
msgstr "不依赖 Info 的方法位于 ``client.exchange``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:25 c2022ea9a9214d03b370fd099ab5879a
msgid "``usd_transfer`` sends USD;"
msgstr "``usd_transfer`` 发送 USD；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:26 2d54c4b175664561bb6791b2433a5449
msgid "``withdraw`` initiates a withdrawal;"
msgstr "``withdraw`` 发起提现；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:27 ca400b6ad57c4a819c186e0dac410ae6
msgid "``usd_class_transfer`` moves USD between spot and perpetual classes;"
msgstr "``usd_class_transfer`` 在 spot 与 perpetual 类别之间转移 USD；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:28 aa92ca0a030c43babb2335ef31ebb83a
msgid "``vault_transfer`` deposits to or withdraws from a vault;"
msgstr "``vault_transfer`` 向 vault 存入或从中提取资金；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:29 089631412a834d2d99d7ad8132670ecf
msgid "``hip3_liquidator_transfer`` moves quote notional for a HIP-3 liquidator;"
msgstr "``hip3_liquidator_transfer`` 为 HIP-3 清算人转移报价名义金额；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:30 9ef95aec9b554cee9a395cb631958cbd
msgid ""
"``staking_deposit``, ``staking_withdraw``, and ``token_delegate`` change "
"staking balances or delegation."
msgstr "``staking_deposit``、``staking_withdraw`` 和 ``token_delegate`` 更改质押余额或委托。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:33 0f4e9d6bfef4431386327feca3cd4c1d
msgid ""
"User-signed fund actions do not accept ``expires_after``. A timeout still"
" leaves their result indeterminate; reconcile balances and ledgers before"
" replacement."
msgstr ""
"用户签名的资金操作不接受 ``expires_after``。超时仍会使其结果不确定；"
"替换前请核对余额和账本。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:37 1f5aec8ae715425a9c43cfa38fe1ec4b
msgid "Account administration"
msgstr "账户管理"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:39 b9035230c85a4feb925393bef11d7f1f
msgid ""
"The Exchange client exposes ``set_referrer_code``, "
"``create_sub_account``, ``use_big_blocks``, ``approve_agent``, "
"``approve_builder_fee``, ``convert_to_multi_sig_user``, account-"
"abstraction methods, and agent-abstraction methods. Approval and multisig"
" changes alter authority; conversion may not have a simple inverse. Read "
"the current role and abstraction state first, then verify it again "
"through trusted Info after acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"Exchange 客户端提供 ``set_referrer_code``、``create_sub_account``、``use_big_blocks``、"
"``approve_agent``、``approve_builder_fee``、``convert_to_multi_sig_user``、账户抽象方法和 agent 抽象方法。"
"批准和多签更改会改变权限；转换可能没有简单的逆操作。请先读取当前角色和抽象状态，"
"再在收到确认后通过可信的 Info 再次验证。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:46 ee3997dec48641509afae21a42c02134
msgid ""
"``reserve_request_weight`` is a paid action. ``schedule_cancel`` affects "
"open orders. ``noop`` advances or reserves the client's nonce stream. "
"None should be used as a generic health check."
msgstr ""
"``reserve_request_weight`` 是付费操作。``schedule_cancel`` 会影响开放订单。"
"``noop`` 推进或保留客户端的 nonce 流。它们都不应用作通用健康检查。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:51 83bdabdc54c34272ad7a2e8eda6729b3
msgid "Outcome and validator actions"
msgstr "Outcome 与验证者操作"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:53 2f11d0ec5fa042eea2b092985ce383a5
msgid ""
"``split_outcome``, ``merge_outcome``, ``merge_question``, and "
"``negate_outcome`` alter outcome-token state. ``vote_risk_free_rate`` and"
" ``authorize_aqav2_role`` are privileged validator or administrative "
"actions. ``claim_rewards`` changes claimable state. Validate protocol-"
"specific eligibility and units outside the SDK before calling them."
msgstr ""
"``split_outcome``、``merge_outcome``、``merge_question`` 和 ``negate_outcome`` 会改变 outcome-token 状态。"
"``vote_risk_free_rate`` 和 ``authorize_aqav2_role`` 是有特权的验证者或管理操作。"
"``claim_rewards`` 更改可领取状态。调用前请在 SDK 外部验证协议特定的资格和单位。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:60 c91416f2efee40b7b2c0eb49b74ac51b
msgid "Response discipline"
msgstr "响应规范"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:62 ab82ea2d2bd84c589ac50f74829ff64b
msgid ""
"These methods usually return ``DefaultActionResponse``. A returned JSON "
"object may still have ``status == \"err\"``; that is an Exchange "
"rejection, not a Python exception. Network ambiguity is handled "
"separately as described in :doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation`."
msgstr ""
"这些方法通常返回 ``DefaultActionResponse``。返回的 JSON 对象仍可能具有 ``status == \"err\"``；"
"那是 Exchange 拒绝，而不是 Python 异常。网络不确定性按 :doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation` 所述单独处理。"
